  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combatting Censorship and Discrimination of Journalists with Intersecting Backgrounds</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective is promoting and protecting human rights of Journalists by empowering CSOs for improving the democratic space in T&#xFC;rkiye&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objective is to support CSOs for countering censorship and discrimination against journalists with intersecting backgrounds in T&#xFC;rkiye.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
